        <mxCell id="guards" value="BookingOffer: missing slot → 404 SLOT_UNAVAILABLE; taken / started / changed day-time → 409 SLOT_UNAVAILABLE (UI clears quote, reloads slots, keeps symptoms); doctor not accepting → 409 DOCTOR_UNAVAILABLE.&#10;Unsupported key → 400 UNSUPPORTED_STRATEGY; missing quote parts → 400 QUOTE_REQUIRED. Every refusal rolls back before any write." style="fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;shadow=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
